
### find all
GET http://localhost:8080/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### find by id
GET http://localhost:8080/purchases/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### find by customer
GET http://localhost:8080/purchases/customer/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### crete purchase
POST http://localhost:8080/purchases
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "value": "300",
  "qtyInstallments": 3,
  "description": "test1"
}